@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 3 (US 4.1.7 – Create VVE)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
	ArrowColor Black
	ActorBorderColor #000000
	ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	LifeLineBorderColor Black
	LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantBorderColor Black
	ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "«container (C4)»\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nVesselVisitExecutionsController" as VVE_CTRL #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nVesselVisitExecutionService" as VVE_SVC #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nVesselVisitExecution" as VVE_DOMAIN #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nIVesselVisitExecutionRepository" as VVE_REPO #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nOEMDbContext" as DB_CTX #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nPort Logistics API Client" as PL_CLIENT #87CEEB
participant "«external»\nIAM" as IAM #F5F5DC

-> UI: 1: request to create VVE
activate UI
UI -> IAM: 1.1: validate token
activate IAM
IAM --> UI: 1.1.1: token valid, get user email
deactivate IAM
UI --> : 1.2: display VVN selection form
deactivate UI

-> UI: 2: select VVN and provide arrival time
activate UI
UI -> VVE_CTRL: 2.1: POST /api/vesselvisitexecutions (CreateVveDTO)
activate VVE_CTRL

VVE_CTRL -> VVE_SVC: 2.1.1: CreateAsync(dto, userEmail)
activate VVE_SVC

VVE_SVC -> PL_CLIENT: 2.1.1.1: GET /api/vesselvisitnotifications/{vvnId}
activate PL_CLIENT
PL_CLIENT --> VVE_SVC: 2.1.1.2: VVN details (vessel, dock, etc.)
deactivate PL_CLIENT

VVE_SVC -> VVE_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.3: new VesselVisitExecution(vvnId, arrivalTime)
activate VVE_DOMAIN
VVE_DOMAIN -> VVE_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.3.1: GenerateId() [pattern like VVN]
VVE_DOMAIN -> VVE_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.3.2: SetStatus(InProgress)
VVE_DOMAIN --> VVE_SVC: 2.1.1.4: VVE entity
deactivate VVE_DOMAIN

VVE_SVC -> VVE_REPO: 2.1.1.5: AddAsync(vve)
activate VVE_REPO
VVE_REPO -> DB_CTX: 2.1.1.5.1: Add(vve)
activate DB_CTX
DB_CTX -> DB_CTX: 2.1.1.5.2: SaveChangesAsync()
DB_CTX --> VVE_REPO: 2.1.1.5.3: saved
deactivate DB_CTX
VVE_REPO --> VVE_SVC: 2.1.1.6: persisted VVE
deactivate VVE_REPO

VVE_SVC --> VVE_CTRL: 2.1.2: VesselVisitExecutionDTO
deactivate VVE_SVC

VVE_CTRL --> UI: 2.2: 201 Created (VVE)
deactivate VVE_CTRL
UI --> : 2.3: display VVE confirmation (status: In Progress)
deactivate UI

@enduml
